            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Unluck Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divination, divine, mental, misfortune)\n\n20 feet. A creature entering the area must attempt a 23 Will save, rolling the save twice and using the worse result. On a successful save, the creature is temporarily immune to fortune eater unluck auras for 24 hours. On a failure, the creature must roll twice and use the worse result on all checks as long as it is within the aura."
